        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Chamberlain, Alex Oxlade-Chamberlain, Neville Chamberlain, Christian Oxlade-Chamberlain, Ernie Moss\n- Organizations: Liverpool F.C., Portsmouth F.C., England national team, Port Vale F.C.\n- Roles: footballer, midfielder, top-scorer\n- Events: 1981–82 Port Vale F.C. season\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Valentine Chamberlain was born on 19 November 1961 and is an English former international footballer.\n- During the 1981–82 Port Vale F.C. season, Ernie Moss was the top-scorer and midfielder Mark Chamberlain was one of the stars of the season.\n- Alexander Mark David Oxlade-Chamberlain was born on 15 August 1993 and is an English professional footballer who plays as a midfielder for Liverpool F.C. and the England national team.\n- Mark Chamberlain is the younger brother of Neville Chamberlain.\n- Mark Chamberlain is the father of Alex Oxlade-Chamberlain and Christian Oxlade-Chamberlain, who has played for Portsmouth F.C.",
